
# JOHARGRAM

### One Community. One World.

Global Photo & Video Sharing Social Media Platform.

## Platforms
- Android
- iOS
- Website

## Main Features
- Photo Sharing
- Video Sharing
- Reels and Stories
- User Profiles
- Likes and Comments
- Follow and Followers
- Private Messaging
- Notifications

## Technology
- Flutter
- Firebase
- Cloud Firestore

